HomeFleet combines ERCOT settlement prices, ORNL EAGLE-I county outage records,
NREL ResStock simulated building loads, NREL SMART-DS synthetic feeder models,
Open-Meteo historical weather, and the Iowa Environmental Mesonet NWS VTEC
archive. The accompanying data card identifies versions, transformations,
source links, and attribution. EAGLE-I v4 and Open-Meteo weather data are
distributed under CC BY 4.0. Open-Meteo attribution and data-license terms:
https://open-meteo.com/en/licence

HomeFleet housing profiles are simulations from ResStock. They are not
telemetry from Base Power or any other battery operator. Hardware and tariff
parameters reproduce a publicly described setting; no affiliation or
endorsement by Base Power, ERCOT, ORNL, NREL, or the data providers is implied.

BLAST-Lite is a separate third-party dependency with its own license. The
NeurIPS style file retains its original copyright and distribution terms.
